Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.03,0:00:04.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总是把自己的体液吐的到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're always spewing their bodily fluids everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当恶心 而且极其不卫生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's creepy. It's downright unsanitary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挡不住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't hold them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挡住谁 - 利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold who back? - Leviathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就像易形者 只是更爱吃人肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like shapeshifters only a lot more into eating folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有东西能杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing can kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 萨姆·温彻斯特绝对来过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Sam winchester was definitely here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会查明他们去了哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll find out where they went from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解我 你知道我是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me. You know the kind of person I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在杀人 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dropping bodies, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就得杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means we got to drop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了救我她杀了她母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}She killed her own mom to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有不得不背着某人做些事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever do something behind someone's back because you had to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改不了你的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会再杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will kill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:47.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡伦 别再质疑自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen, don't second-guess yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的房子确实漂亮极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your house is beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.10,0:00:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不也反复告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but didn't you tell me a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.79,0:00:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是里克心爱的房子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it's Rick's dream house?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它卖掉就是在惩罚他 卡伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selling it is how you punish his ass, Karen,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.71,0:01:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历过那么多痛苦 这不是你应得的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and after what you've been through, don't you deserve that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你应得的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天就把那些文件准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the papers ready tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我为你骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay! I'm proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.74,0:01:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you are. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要十分钟 有什么事就说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 minutes. Holler if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.39,0:01:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.76,0:02:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chri…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. Chris, get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Somebody, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第5集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远一点 我说了闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone! I said shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.22,0:03:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改不了你的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会再杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will kill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:40.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（兴隆市档案 「离奇死亡」有一个搜索结果）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑成这德行 有人在追你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody better be chasing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对身体有益处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,才没益处呢 看看你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it's not good for you. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一团糟 而且很臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you're a mess, and you stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你硬装兰斯·阿姆斯特朗（七届环法冠军）时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, while you were out being Lance Armstrong…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.35,0:04:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是骑自行车的 - 我在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That would be biking. - …I was working.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有听说过印第安纳州的兴隆市\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever heard of a town called Prosperity, Indiana?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有人听说过这小地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.41,0:04:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去的两周里有两位优秀市民死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of their fine citizens died over the past two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个女的 她在美发沙龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one chick … she, uh, roasted underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,被那种蜂窝式干发器烤焦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of those beehive hair dryers at the hair salon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一人洗热水浴时被煮熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this other guy boiled in a hot tub.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这倒是不常见 - 确实是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't see a lot of that. - No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 值得去调查一番 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's worth checking out. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.99,0:04:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经谈过了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have had this conversation, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.89,0:04:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要想谈 你得… 知道吗 你得说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, to do that, you'd have to, uh, sort of…speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.77,0:04:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我这么说看你明白不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's see if you can get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道你是一个新…新的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you're … you're new sam, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像兰斯·阿姆斯特朗 - 他骑自行车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lance Armstrong. - Biking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我还只是我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh … and I'm still me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你现在对事物的看法可能变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so … so, you might see things different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是你跑亢奋了还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it a runner's high or some crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并不意味着我有什么事 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that doesn't mean that something's going on with me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.42,0:05:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 别用「好吧」敷衍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't say, "yeah, okay, " like, "yeah, okay."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.68,0:05:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,头儿 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我明白温彻斯特兄弟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I definitely do realize this Winchester thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,耽搁过久了 对此我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}is taking far too long, and I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一天半后就应该能到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be there in a day and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我这就出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll hit the road now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是停下来补给一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stopped for a quick refuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.62,0:05:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 这是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. It'll be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:54.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（印第安纳州 兴隆市）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:05:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道现在说这些让你很不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I know this is a tough time to have to talk about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经跟那些律师 警察 保险公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already been through it so many times with the lawyers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,说过很多遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the police, the insurance guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 我们要进行独立的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just … we have to conduct our own separate investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我知道这很难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I know it's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问问 你妹妹有没有仇家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you … did your sister have any enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.18,0:06:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问这个做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you ask that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为她的死不是意外事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think her death wasn't accidental?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是这个意思 只是要考虑各种可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no. We just have to consider every possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有谁可能想要伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anyone who might have wanted to harm her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不住这儿 所以就不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't live here, so you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,温蒂的人缘很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone…Loved Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.57,0:06:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在教堂做义工\N{\fnArial\fs30}She volunteered at the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,运作一个儿童慈善组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ran a group for kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.85,0:06:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是她的姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the big sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对她也很尊敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I looked up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个死者名叫卡尔·邓洛普\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this man who died … Carl Dunlap?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她认不认识 - 应该不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did she know him? - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,温蒂在房产公司工作 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Wendy was in real estate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔是建筑师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl was an architect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.50,0:06:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会不会有过业务往来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they had some business dealings?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.69,0:06:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们有过来往 我应该听说过这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they had worked together, I would've heard the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨博拉探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Sambora…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我妹妹是被害死的 请找出凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If someone did this to my sister, find out who.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.59,0:07:07.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（约瑟芬美发店）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时这里就只有温蒂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody was back here but Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.36,0:07:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我只离开了一分钟而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was only gone for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西是有温限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't even crank these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能动手脚做改变 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}past a certain temperature … am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果烧断了保险丝什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it started to blow a fuse or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会自动关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would have shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,总而言之 你认为这种事情不可能发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, you're saying that this couldn't have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,总而言之 我认为这种事不可能发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, I'm saying it couldn't have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险理算员已经检查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The insurance adjusters already did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢提醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the heads-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.78,0:07:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样子的硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What kind of a coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是美国的币种 不知道是哪儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not American. I don't know where it's from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.03,0:07:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它插在其中一台机器的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was wedged back behind one of those machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是有人丢在那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody could have dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 他们让顾客穿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, they don't have pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种长衣服没有口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}in those robe things that they make you wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你对做美容还很有研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize you were such a spa expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 我那是观察仔细\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. I observe with my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧好吧 随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah, whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你认为这玩意儿肯定是某种符咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you thinking it must be some kind of hex talisman?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.97,0:08:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 过来接我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Pick me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑步回家多好啊 兰斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just run home, Lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一会儿就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll be there in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:14.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（凡酒吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:20.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杜威·斯蒂文斯建筑工程）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对死者有什么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we know about the vic?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.39,0:09:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜威·斯蒂文斯 老板 他的建筑公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dewey Stevens … owner, Dewey Stevens Construction,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这儿最大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}biggest outfit in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是扶轮社会员 卫理公会教徒 男高音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotarian, methodist, tenor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,做山核桃派的手艺一流 患哮喘病\N{\fnArial\fs30}blue-ribbon pecan pie champ, asthmatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.56,0:10:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个社区很小\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a close-knit community.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.66,0:10:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位社区的重要人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this, um, pillar of the community …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,挨钉子之前 他正在撒尿 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was taking a leak before he, uh, sprung a few?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,员工都已经走了 这里也关闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crew had gone for the day. Site was shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了眼睛里的钉子 还有什么异常发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything unusual besides the nails in the eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.69,0:10:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在调查射钉枪是怎么通电的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still trying to figure out where they plugged in the nail gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为卡车上没有发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing as there's no generator on the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等调查出来了就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when you figure that out, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是一个人见人爱的死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, another victim everybody likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人不爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一起不可能发生的死亡事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another physically impossible death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有什么想法 - 耍杂技的干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got any ideas? - Cirque du soleil?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.47,0:11:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起来了 又找到一枚硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I, uh, found another one of these,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟烫发烤头机那里的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like at the, uh, the hair-dryer/brain-roast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了这些死者之间的关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I found a connection with all the vics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,从电邮日志来看 那个做房地产的女孩温蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}These e-mail logs show Wendy, the real-estate chick,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个建筑师卡尔 和这个杜威\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, the architect, and this Dewey guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾合作过一个购物中心的项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}were all working on a shopping-center project together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.41,0:11:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前怎么不知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't we know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道为什么 项目突然中断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it all fell apart for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些邮件来来往往的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there are these e-mails back and forth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,收发相当频繁 突然间就这么中止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty hot and heavy, and suddenly they just stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.73,0:11:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 参与这项工程的人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, everybody working on this project has died?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没全死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是给一个叫做唐·斯达克的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were working with a developer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,开发商打工的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a guy named Don Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐·斯达克 我怎么听过这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Stark? Why do I know that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（唐纳德·斯达克 兴隆市基金会创始人）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 这个斯达克还真是德高望重啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this Stark guy is really plugged in, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 只要是这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, all the players in this …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:11:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个购物中心工程的参与者\N{\fnArial\fs30}this shopping-center project.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是被油炸 水煮就是被当成肉串烤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}have either fried, boiled, or kebabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个可能是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还喝瓶装酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a freaking flask?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成圣诞坏公公了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, bad Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.01,0:12:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再说我们在工作 - 我们总在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On the job? - We're always on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.77,0:12:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 鲍比回复邮件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Bobby e-mailed back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给他发了几张你发现的硬币的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent him a few pics of those coins you found.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.43,0:12:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说上面的文字是罗马尼亚的斯拉夫字母\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says the writing is Romanian Cyrillic,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只在十五世纪中期到十九世纪使用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}used only in the mid-15th to the 19th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是枚古老的瓦拉几亚硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, it's an antique Wallachian ducat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们是要找一个高龄罗马尼亚人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're looking for an old Romanian?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我觉得这个很怪异吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, is it just me, or is this really weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前见到过这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen this once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个地方一片的植物都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}where t-the plants are all dead in one spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张上面有着温蒂·古德逊照片的公交站长凳\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bus bench with Wendy Goodson's picture on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.15,0:12:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是专家 可是我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm no expert, but I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,植物该变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}plants are supposed to act like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是联调局都出动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the bureau's involved,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你认为这三个人是被谋杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you think all three were murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去是那么回事 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's looking that way, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯达克先生 你曾与这三位死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Mr. Stark, you had a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,都打过交道 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all three victims, isn't that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在商界结识的他们 可以这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I knew them in business circles, I guess, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都曾参与过一个购物中心的项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were all involved in a, uh, a-a shopping-center project.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可为什么项目落空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd that fall through?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事常有发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, t-these things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.23,0:13:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.02,0:13:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两位先生从联调局而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}These gentlemen are from the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮·克莱恩 我的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny Klein, my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.55,0:13:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 我去洗衣店了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Don, I'm off to the cleaner's,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.11,0:13:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后去养蜂人公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm gonna stop at beaman, beaman, and beaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,处理修订合同的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the revised contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去快回 你知道很多事没你不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry on back. You know how things fall apart without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你烤了些杯型蛋糕 椰子味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I baked you some cupcakes … coconut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,椰子味的 你对我真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coconut … you're too good to me, Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.27,0:13:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会烤杯型蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}She bakes cupcakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人垂涎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:13:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,能告诉我洗手间在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Could you point me to the restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚喝多了咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a little bit too much java.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.31,0:14:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着走廊 在拐角处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, around the corner, down the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般像这样的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, usually in cases like these …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.29,0:14:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有过这样的情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there cases like these?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来吓你一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'd be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从最基本的开始着手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we start out with the basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么商业竞争对手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any business rivals?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 多了去了 房地产界很残酷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, tons. You know, real estate's brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是答得爽快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我对这里的爱有目共睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, i've demonstrated my love for this town,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以毫不夸张地说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think it's safe to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里的作为是受人敬重的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm respected for what I've done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的真正的珍宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, one of my real treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:25.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（年度市民 唐·斯达克）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「致唐 赶尽杀绝 唐·特朗普」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To Don … take no prisoners. D. Trump."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.86,0:15:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,特朗普建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trumpster! Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.09,0:15:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我所说 成功衍生了激烈的竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, success breeds fierce competition,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最终 这里的每个人都敬重我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in the end, everyone here respects and admires me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括你的妻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们听说你们在闹分居 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. It's just, we heard the two of you were splitting up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们…我们确实听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's, uh … that's what we heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 玛姬和我现在关系有些紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Maggie and I are going through a tough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实在分居 不过是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a separation … temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 两个人会疏远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, you know, you grow apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.30,0:15:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能怪任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no one's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你会怎么形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how would you describe the, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你妻子之间的问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}the issues between you and your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 只是那种夫妻间的误会罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one of those marital misunderstandings, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 抱歉 我不太明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sorry. I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那种不明所以 说不清楚的争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of those vague, hard-to-define passages.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她抓到你偷腥 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She caught you cheating, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't help but notice, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你助理之间的挺来劲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}things were kind of cordial between you and your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.07,0:16:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟女士们的关系很好吧 斯达克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good with the ladies there, Mr. Stark?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.82,0:16:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是痛并快乐着 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a blessing and a curse, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我人缘很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I'm a people person,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也欣赏活力充沛 自信满满的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I admire dynamic, confident women.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.18,0:16:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是欣赏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Admire"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look … it's true I had a recent…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我的生意伙伴有点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}little thing with a business associate,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's all it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 东西 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A "Thing"? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得像只鞋或者高尔夫俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a … like a shoe or a golf club.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.68,0:16:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像华夫饼烤模 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. Like a waffle iron. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 唐 妻子们通常都把外遇看得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, see, Don, uh, wives generally think of an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,比「事」要严重得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}as something more than a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 所以玛姬发现这事的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and when Maggie found out about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要分开一段时间 只是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}she needed some time off, temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:16:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果我们猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if we were to guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:17:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个生意伙伴是温蒂·古德逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the, uh, uh, business associate was Wendy Goodson,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.83,0:17:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,能算中头奖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would we win the weekend trip to Maui?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她的死跟外遇无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, her death had nothing to do with the affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在她死前很久就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over long before her accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是意外致死的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.29,0:17:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会是在暗示玛姬是幕后黑手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not implying that Maggie was behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们什么都没有暗示\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not implying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.06,0:17:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在说 你要小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just saying… you should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,请她吃晚餐并且道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take her to dinner and apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 低声下气点 不会少块肉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and, uh, grovel. Wouldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有一堆巫术用品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found a bunch of hex junk in their stuff …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然她挺有研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly her thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且她衣柜空荡荡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the empty closet didn't seem like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她近期是不会搬回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was coming back anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.61,0:17:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐欣赏温蒂 神圣地欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Don admires Wendy, biblically,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,温蒂莫名其妙地死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy dies weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,被轻视的妻子则喜欢黑巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the scorned wife is into the dark stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.17,0:17:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而唐还全然不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}While Don's just in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:45.80,Title,0,0,0,0,,还真有点像《家有仙妻》（美国老电视剧）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. It's kind of like "Bewitched".
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐就是戴霖（男主角） 完全不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Don's Darrin, doesn't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前都挺喜剧 直到你出轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot laughs until, uh, you cheat on your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:52.95,Title,0,0,0,0,,用《家有仙妻》作比喻 你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A "Bewitched" reference. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 翻拍电影可是妮可·基德曼演的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, Nicole Kidman was in the remake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个红发美女 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redhead. Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.23,0:17:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些枯死的植物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at all these dead plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟房地产小姐那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. It's kind of like the real-estate lady's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有唐的雕塑那里一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Don's statue thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.14,0:18:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if she's strong enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.43,0:18:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且被惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just being pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有能力冲他们发泄不满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is enough to send some pretty bad vibes their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多就是一个怒发冲冠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally kill off everything around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能撂倒一片\N{\fnArial\fs30}just by pms-ing at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不恐怖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eeh. That's not creepy at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我是迪恩 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, hey, it's Dean. Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特 真搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester. Yeah, very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we need our kind of terminix.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在开车去她家了解具体情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're headed over to her place to get you some more specifics,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.49,0:18:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if you could just, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y… thank y…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.17,0:18:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在着手准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:47.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拉尔森地产）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.91,0:19:37.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（詹妮弗·克莱恩）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.79,0:19:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐 兄弟 管好你的小弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don, keep it in your pants, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.47,0:19:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,线路忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All circuits are busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯达克太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,能谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could I have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.97,0:20:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能等会再来吗 大概 过半个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, would you mind coming back in, say, a half an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在真不是个好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a really bad time right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.69,0:20:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跟你谈谈 这真的很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very important that I talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我也很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, and I'm happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.76,0:20:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我现在有急事要办 请你等会再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just in the middle of an emergency, so please come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.47,0:20:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry …
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,下肢不宁综合症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Restless Leg Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:20:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,剧透了 詹妮·克莱恩是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoiler alert … Jenny Klein's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她的照片从巫术祭台上拿下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swiped her photo off a hex deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是玛姬最终都会发现照片不见了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Maggie's gonna notice it's gone eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.31,0:21:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶去詹妮家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get over to Jenny's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.59,0:22:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那枚硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the coin, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.93,0:22:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.71,0:23:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的蛋糕里面有跳动的小心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were tiny beating hearts in my cupcakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的蛋糕里面有心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}there were hearts in my cupcakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.63,0:23:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的蛋糕里面有心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}hearts in my cupcakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.16,0:23:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,前所未闻啊 我的蛋糕里怎么会有心脏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's never happened before! Hearts in my cupcakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.73,0:23:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我打昏她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I slug her?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.53,0:23:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她冷静会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.39,0:23:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊 刚刚发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.12,0:23:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被下咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were hexed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.14,0:23:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,下咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hexed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.91,0:23:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.12,0:23:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要做的就是进去打包行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you do is you go in there and you pack a bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get in your car, and you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.57,0:23:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去哪里 - 随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go where? - It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.21,0:23:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便开出去五六百里就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}500 or 600 miles ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.11,0:23:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹怒了某些个强大的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got someone real powerful real pissed,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.32,0:23:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在要除掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're trying to get rid of you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,与此同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In line with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好缓一缓你和唐·斯达克的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might want to cool things with Don Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.57,0:23:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐·斯达克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Stark?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.50,0:23:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.22,0:23:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.27,0:23:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.57,0:23:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You know"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.15,0:24:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么那什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no "You know."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.20,0:24:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.29,0:24:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐·斯达克是我的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Stark is my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.01,0:24:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.79,0:24:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他可结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's married, for god's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.54,0:24:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.65,0:24:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和唐·斯达克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Don Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.33,0:24:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.37,0:24:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这些桌子往中间靠靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch these tables more in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.96,0:24:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让油画间的空间更大点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a more air between paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 玛姬 签收下花吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Maggie, can you sign for the flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我检查过了 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've checked them. They're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.94,0:24:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 苏 没有你我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sue. What would I do without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.71,0:24:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气 我喜欢帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please, I like helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.16,0:24:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁叫我们是好朋友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are best friends for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是唐的事 实在是太让人费心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just been so tough to focus with Don, the whole mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.15,0:24:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像往你心上扎刀子 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like he put a knife right in your heart, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.65,0:24:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.57,0:24:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是不该告诉你他和温蒂的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was I wrong to tell you about him and Wendy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.43,0:24:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.11,0:24:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会宁愿你袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'd want you to stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.53,0:24:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我被他耍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and watch him make a fool of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.66,0:24:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你的做法 - 我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you for what you did. - I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.04,0:24:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 静物不放在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. The still life doesn't go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.75,0:24:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,往左边放\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes on the left side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.76,0:24:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, we're gonna need, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个桌子中间放个装饰品 后边也需要两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}one centerpiece on each of the tables and two at the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.11,0:24:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唐 - 我老婆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don. - Where's my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.92,0:25:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说要和你离婚的那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the one who's divorcing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.55,0:25:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏 我知道你迫不及待想让我滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sue, I know you can hardly wait until I'm out of the picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.67,0:25:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道在玛姬耳边撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know it's been a thrill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.03,0:25:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,说悄悄话让你激动不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}whispering lies into Maggie's ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.67,0:25:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些可不是谎话 是吗 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, but they weren't lies, were they, Don?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.44,0:25:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只犯了一个错 一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made one mistake … one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.65,0:25:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sincerely doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.02,0:25:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是玛姬和我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is between Maggie and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.50,0:25:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.28,0:25:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Don?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.22,0:25:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.05,0:25:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.49,0:25:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.38,0:25:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.02,0:25:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我很有耐心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've been patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.89,0:25:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也找到乐子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've had your fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.13,0:25:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,温蒂的事 你耍的花招挺厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was very creative, the thing with Wendy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.69,0:25:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 收手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, enough is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.05,0:25:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 唐 不够 还远远不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Don, enough is not enough, not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.36,0:25:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干吗 杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, my oysters on a tray?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.94,0:25:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你都这么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that you mention it …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.63,0:25:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是 这些都不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact is, none of this was my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.21,0:25:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能多陪陪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if you'd been around a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.41,0:25:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管这些艺术品 慈善 还有那个碎嘴的苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}But between the art and the charity and that evil bitch Sue,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.34,0:25:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在几乎不存在于你的生活中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was edged right out of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.13,0:25:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人物先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boo-hoo, Mr.Big shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.49,0:26:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我得把名字烙在镇上每件公共设施上」先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr."I got to put my name on every public works in town."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.30,0:26:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的婚姻里有三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was three of us in this marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.22,0:26:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 你 以及你的自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}me, you, and your ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.84,0:26:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是问题所在 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the problem, don.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.14,0:26:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思了 我要去安排慈善活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, excuse me. I have a charity event to arrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.28,0:26:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个联调局的人来过 问了些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two FBI agents came by, asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.81,0:26:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人 甜心 他们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters, sweetheart … that's what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.46,0:26:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你对我的安全还挺关心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you're terribly concerned for my safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.96,0:26:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是别担心 我能处理好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but don't worry … I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.90,0:26:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 别干了 听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, this stops. you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.18,0:26:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}As of now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.58,0:26:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你命令我的时候真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so cute when you try to tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.58,0:27:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她越来越恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now she's just getting nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.54,0:27:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死女友是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing the girlfriend is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.97,0:27:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这雕像弄爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his commemorative bust?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.62,0:27:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's got to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会干掉整个镇子的人 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll take the whole town out, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.71,0:27:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可不管谁挡道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She don't care who gets in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.25,0:27:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 找到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.51,0:27:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 这个对她管用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You think it'll take her out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.66,0:27:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.81,0:27:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用写下来 我记得住 继续吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't need to write it down. I'll remember. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.11,0:27:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 等下 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The … wait. Hang on. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.06,0:27:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么 慢点 慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what… Hold on. Hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.68,0:27:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那最后一个是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the … what was that last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.67,0:27:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.06,0:28:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得住 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll remember. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.34,0:28:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 欢迎你们的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, everyone, and thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.06,0:28:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们大多数人都清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.89,0:28:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,慈善和艺术是我的两大最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}that philanthropy and art are my two passions,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.40,0:28:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们 别放那\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what we've … not there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.20,0:28:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰在哪 人们马上就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the ice? people will be here in seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.28,0:28:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚在此展示的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we've assembled here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.78,0:28:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我今生最大的成就 不是显摆\N{\fnArial\fs30}may be my crowning achievement, not to be immodest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.28,0:28:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 我就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.87,0:28:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切完美无暇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你正好提醒我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you just reminded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.14,0:28:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去检查下手指三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to check on the finger sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.48,0:28:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老兄 - 派\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude. - Pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.87,0:28:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.70,0:28:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡爪 配方里要求的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicken feet, just like the recipe calls for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.70,0:28:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 屠夫家的冰箱坏了 - 我闻出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Butcher's fridge is down. - I can smell that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.55,0:28:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说是电力出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the power's been wonky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.34,0:28:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他损失了大量商品\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that he's lost so much product,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.82,0:28:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,都快要付不出租金了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He probably won't make rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.16,0:29:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,街上每家店都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ditto every shop on the block …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.05,0:29:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都有管道破裂和停电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but burst pipes and blackouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.07,0:29:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说好像是一夜之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says it's like all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.34,0:29:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个镇子的染上了晦气\N{\fnArial\fs30}the town ran out of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.73,0:29:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, coincidence, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.54,0:29:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.93,0:29:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,枯花现在不叫事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're past the point of dead flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.55,0:29:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那能怎么办 我猜巫婆火人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say? I guess the witch is pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.47,0:29:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们还是赶快把这个弄完吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's, we better get a move on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.25,0:29:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你 你把这爪子拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just … can you take the feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.40,0:29:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.87,0:29:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没你我绝对做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.82,0:29:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.82,0:29:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.54,0:29:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.21,0:29:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.84,0:30:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动我的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.50,0:30:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 这怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie? what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.84,0:30:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.02,0:30:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.68,0:30:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道这对我很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew what this meant to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.91,0:30:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说唐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mean don?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.24,0:30:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐操控了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don rigged all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.06,0:30:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 怎么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes! - But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.91,0:30:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.97,0:30:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想让我伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.33,0:30:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 他是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you … he's a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.48,0:30:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们能挺过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.20,0:30:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你还有爱你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you have people who love you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.45,0:30:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他无法将这些人夺走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he can't take that away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.50,0:30:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 唐纳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, donald.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.37,0:31:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来开战吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's war.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.17,0:31:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.93,0:31:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理下7号厅吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean-up on aisle 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.55,0:31:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她应该不会这样破坏自己的拍卖吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I don't guess she'd do this to her own auction.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.09,0:31:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然是有个恨她入骨的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, obviously it was someone who hated her guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.70,0:31:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,想让她的聚会泡汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wanted her party trashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.28,0:31:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐·斯达克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don Stark.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.52,0:31:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小子自己也是个巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the mister's a witch, himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.59,0:31:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着我们要对付不只一个气头上的巫婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means we got not just one pissed-off witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.37,0:31:44.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,他俩要上演《错对冤家》了（福克斯1989年电影）\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got two. It's full-on "War of the Roses".
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.20,0:31:45.97,Title,0,0,0,0,,《家有仙妻》现在不那么喜剧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Bewitched" just got a lot less funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.97,0:31:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲剧得像他们换掉戴琳的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like when they switched Darrins.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.60,0:32:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.55,0:32:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.59,0:32:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经干掉了对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been throwing thunderbolts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.80,0:32:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,最喜欢的玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}at each other's favorite toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.86,0:32:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就剩他们两个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing left to destroy but each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.30,0:32:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要爆发肯定是在这里了 - 希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is basically ground zero. - I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.73,0:32:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把两个都干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.69,0:32:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,得要他们出现在同一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the same place if we're gonna take them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.47,0:32:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐蔽 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screens up, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.60,0:32:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来一杯吗宝贝 - 边儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want one, sweetie? - Shove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.74,0:32:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你死就是我亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so having it out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.91,0:32:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.31,0:32:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.66,0:32:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡爪子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicken feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.86,0:32:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够冰喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not chilled?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.51,0:33:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你们不能离开这个房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For obvious reasons, you won't be leaving this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.08,0:33:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能离开 只是不能活着离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you will be leaving … just not alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.39,0:33:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.34,0:33:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.33,0:33:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 备用计划 - 啥是备用计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, plan "B". - What's plan "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.41,0:33:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.62,0:33:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在吗 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.66,0:33:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然这是夫妻吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is obviously a domestic dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.23,0:33:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们搞不死他们 就劝劝他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you can't kill them, counsel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.32,0:33:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你猜怎么着 不是我的专长啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You know what? Not my area!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.32,0:33:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.80,0:33:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 好了 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.87,0:33:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look … obviously, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.87,0:33:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全有能力干掉对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}are capable of wiping each other out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.92,0:33:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们没那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you haven't, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.90,0:33:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that you two …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.02,0:33:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还珍惜你们之间的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}you still value whatever it is you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.74,0:33:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还希望和彼此继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and you want keep that dance going.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.94,0:33:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 也许是上天的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's … maybe it's punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.68,0:33:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这就是病态的 混乱的 色情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's … it's sick, messed-up, erotic,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.49,0:33:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,重口味的 掐死你温柔那种爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}kinky, "clamps and feathers" kind of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.40,0:34:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 说得太深刻了兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, t-that's … that's going way too deep, there, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想说的是 你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, what he's trying to say is that … is that you two …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.60,0:34:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你们心连着心\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever it is you have, you're bonded.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.45,0:34:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑子秀逗了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.70,0:34:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出轨了 羞辱了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cheated on me, humiliated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.79,0:34:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是说他所做的都对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not trying to say what don did was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.97,0:34:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可一旦关系出现裂痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a relationship cracks,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.76,0:34:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般双方都是有责任的\N{\fnArial\fs30}usually both parties have a hand in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.14,0:34:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.46,0:34:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还替他狡辩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're defending him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.01,0:34:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.60,0:34:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没人能替他狡辩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look … n-nobody can defend Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.91,0:34:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? Uh, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.93,0:34:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们懂你觉得他背叛了你 也确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, we get that you feel betrayed…Because you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.05,0:34:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别奉承她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't suck up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.84,0:34:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实受到了背叛 他们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was betrayed by all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.42,0:34:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔把你介绍给温蒂 杜威为你掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl introduced you to Wendy. Dewey covered for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.21,0:34:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 温蒂和你上床 - 好了好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wendy did you! - Okay, okay, look …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.75,0:34:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说我觉得唐说他很后悔和温蒂的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say I-I don't think Don was lying when he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.18,0:34:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是谎话\N{\fnArial\fs30}he regrets the whole Wendy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.77,0:34:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,事\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.42,0:34:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.06,0:34:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 外遇 你是对的 这很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, affair … that's right, terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.47,0:35:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他唯一的后悔是被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the only thing he regrets is getting caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.79,0:35:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,温蒂对我无足轻重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wendy was nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.92,0:35:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over as soon as it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.77,0:35:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不过是其中一个而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was part of a pattern, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.01,0:35:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这八百年都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had 800 years of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.35,0:35:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我提起文艺复兴时候的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not make me bring up the Renaissance!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.86,0:35:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还敢说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.88,0:35:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,1492年的事有印象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}1492 ring any bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.57,0:35:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小子都要去远航了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man was about to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.22,0:35:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他搞不好会从世界边缘掉下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could possibly fall off of the edge of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.74,0:35:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很可怜他 那你的理由是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took pity. So, what's your excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.12,0:35:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我和那个姓梅第奇（文艺复兴时期佛罗伦萨著名家族）的没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you … nothing happened with the Medici chick!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.64,0:35:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都是个大醋坛子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always been insanely jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.29,0:35:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有果必有因 詹妮 温蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wonder why! Jenny. Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.11,0:35:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟詹妮更没什么了 她只是我助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny? Nothing happened with Jenny. She's just my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.18,0:35:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.22,0:35:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟我们说了 只是助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}She, uh … she told us … just an assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.36,0:35:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.27,0:35:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我发誓 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I swear it, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.38,0:35:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.85,0:35:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.56,0:35:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.80,0:35:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没 看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.37,0:35:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们…终于能好好谈谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys… You're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.72,0:36:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年 你们把愤怒和失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these years, you … you buried your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.21,0:36:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,憋在心里 直到这毁了你们的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your disappointment till it tore you apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.10,0:36:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实你们只需要好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you needed to do was talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.63,0:36:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脑壳也不会挨那一遭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would have missed the nuking that my melon just took.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.24,0:36:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都不想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who wants that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.51,0:36:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妙招啊 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice touch. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.16,0:36:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.36,0:36:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.66,0:36:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辈子我只想要你 玛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ever wanted is you, Mags.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.16,0:36:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been crushing on you since forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.79,0:36:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想执子之手 与子不老\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the woman that I want to never grow old with.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.41,0:36:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也绝不会杀你 唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never murder you either, Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.06,0:36:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很疯狂…但却是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crazy… But true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.14,0:36:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能喊个停吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody want to call these things off?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.76,0:36:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 打扰下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ex… excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.94,0:37:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.19,0:37:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可什么也没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.40,0:37:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天太不容易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.49,0:37:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没完事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.58,0:37:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.76,0:37:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.56,0:37:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认识你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.32,0:37:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然认识你们 你们是死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I definitely know you. You're the dead guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.16,0:37:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少马上就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you will be in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.91,0:37:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你不够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. You're a bit outmatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.72,0:38:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.42,0:38:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我们欠你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. We owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.71,0:38:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 那什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good god. What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.70,0:38:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们应该查个明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we should be figuring that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.45,0:38:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们的待查事件簿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is on our to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.09,0:38:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个无底洞 把尸体处理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, find a bottomless pit and drop it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.34,0:38:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒语只能维持数日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spell only lasts for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.46,0:38:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what are you even doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.69,0:38:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 是来救你们命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, saving your lives …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.41,0:38:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.65,0:38:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.69,0:38:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.23,0:38:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要置我们于死地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was gonna kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.97,0:38:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还刚挽救了你们的婚姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just saved your damn marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 可公平来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but to be fair,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.29,0:38:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也试图杀她来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}you also tried to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.09,0:38:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.70,0:38:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她发起火来的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she gets a bug up her ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.76,0:38:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真叫人不得不爱 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to love her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.92,0:38:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.18,0:38:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 无底洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottomless pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.97,0:38:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ciao.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.28,0:39:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以转移他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's ready for transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.53,0:39:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好有地方安置他 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope you got someplace you can put him, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.20,0:39:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.88,0:39:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得出发了 你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should hit the road. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.08,0:39:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, were you, um …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.41,0:39:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有在听今晚斯达克夫妇的谈话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}were you listening to the Starks tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.71,0:39:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听了一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, a little,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.52,0:39:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我没被煽向墙面或是被蜜蜂群殴期间\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I wasn't getting slammed into a wall or stung by bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.11,0:39:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注意到他们是怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You notice how they, uh … you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.43,0:39:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么敞开心扉\N{\fnArial\fs30}how they … how they opened up,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.73,0:39:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一吐为快的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}got everything off their chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.89,0:39:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 你成功推销了你那套歪理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Kudos on selling them that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.91,0:39:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是歪理论 迪恩 是有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't crap, Dean. It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.88,0:39:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我现在非常 非常 非常累\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I am so very, very, very, very…very, very tired …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.47,0:39:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 不管你愿不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, like it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.98,0:39:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想说出的那些心事不会自行消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}the stuff you don't talk about doesn't just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.45,0:39:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是会越来越沉重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It builds up,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.87,0:39:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就比如现在折磨着你的心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}like whatever's eating at you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.22,0:39:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是有心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always something eating at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.24,0:39:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.36,0:39:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.10,0:39:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就觉得是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel responsible, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.60,0:39:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,林德伯格婴儿案 那事责任在我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lindbergh baby … that's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.13,0:39:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,失业 由我而起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unemployment … my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.68,0:40:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.66,0:40:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你究竟想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then what the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.47,0:40:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指你不想说的那件心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about whatever you're not telling me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.01,0:40:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.74,0:40:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全可以一吐为快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can unload.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.87,0:40:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不就是干这个的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of what I'm here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.32,0:40:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没问题的 可以交心的 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean… We're good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.30,0:40:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.
